<title>USA: Parker &amp; Parsley files for $400 mln offering.</title>
<headline>Parker &amp; Parsley files for $400 mln offering.</headline>
<dateline>MIDLAND, Texas 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Parker &amp; Parsley Petroleum Co said Thursday it hs filed a shelf registration covering up to $400 million in stock.</p>
<p>The $400 million includes $127.9 million that was registered in a shelf registration statement in 1994, but has not been used, it said.</p>
<p>The net proceeds are to be used for general corporate purposes, which may include paying back debt, working capital and redemption or repurchase of securities.</p>
<p>Parker &amp; Parsley is an oil and gas exploration and production company.</p>
</text>
